            "text": "The AR-15 case now has a date, and the United States has taken a side.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "The Supreme Court will hear the consolidated “assault weapon” ban cases on Wednesday, December 2. On Friday the Justice Department filed a brief telling the justices those bans are unconstitutional — using a common-use test that would protect the rifle and leave the NFA largely where it sits.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
