            "text": "• SCOTUS sets Viramontes/Grant for argument Wed Dec 2, 10am, one hour\n• DOJ amicus: AR-15 bans unconstitutional — but read its common-use test\n• Full, unconditional pardons for Adamiak and Peterson; precedent untouched\n• 27 state AGs file for the petitioners; TN and KS leading the coalition",
